  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">TI Anti-korrup 2006</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TI Prevent corruptio 2006</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programm&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att f&#xF6;rebygga korruption genom att avleda humanit&#xE4;r assistans till den t&#xE4;nkta m&#xE5;lgruppen. Fas 1 kommer fokusera p&#xE5; att identifiera korruptions risker inom det humanit&#xE4;ra bist&#xE5;ndet. Fas 2 kommer utveckla en handbok med best practice baserat p&#xE5; det som identifierats som risker i Fas 1 f&#xF6;r att f&#xF6;rebygga korruption.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The prgoram goal is to prevent corruption from diverting humaniarian assistance from intended beneficiaries. 1st phase will focus on a diagnosis of corruption risks in humanitarian assistance. 2nd phase will focus on developing a Handbook of best practices and tools organised around the humanitarian relief processes set out in the Risk Map (from 1st phase) to help reduce corruption.</narrative>
  </description>
